# Documentation mods for Forge 1.19.2

These mods help provide information to the player and guide them through content in the modpack.


| Name | Links | Description | Alternatives |
|------|-------|-------------| --------------|
| FTB Quests | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-quests-forge) | GUI-based questing mod | - |
| Modonomicon | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modonomicon) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/modonomicon) | Data-driven minecraft in-game documentation with progress visualization | - |
| Patchouli | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/patchouli) | Accessible, Data-Driven, Dependency-Free Documentation for Minecraft Modders and Pack Makers | - |
| QuestLog | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/questlog) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/questlog) | Adds an intuitive questing system | - |

\* - A must-have mod for nearly any modpack. Only in very rare circumstances should you not use this mod or an equivalent.

** - Prone to issues or conflicts with other mods
